source: src/ui/mod.rs
expression: "text(&draw(&a, 44, 90))"
---
 PR Pulse                             ↻ 18s
 ▲▲1 ▲1 ◆1 △3 ◷2
 ATTENTION (gutter; stacks sort by worst
 layer)
 ▲▲       urgent: CI failing + agent idle
 ▲        needs you: CI ✗, changes,
          conflicts
 △        nudge: behind base, threads, no
          reviewer
 ◆        ready to merge now
 ◷        waiting: lower layer, reviews or
          CI

 STATE
 ●        ready for review
 ◌        draft

 CI
 ✓ pass   all checks pass (n/m shown)
 ✗ name   failing; first failed check named
 ◐ n/m    running; n of m checks done
 – none   no checks configured or pushed
 ·1 opt ✗ optional check failing

 THREADS
 ◇ n      n unresolved review threads
 · 0      none unresolved

 REVIEW
 ✓        approved
 ✗        changes requested
 ○ n      pending; n reviewers yet to review
 ∅        no reviewers assigned (dim on
          drafts)

 MERGE (upper layers show waiting instead)
 ✓        clean, can merge
 ⊘        blocked by branch rules (e.g.
          review)
 ↓ n      behind base by n commits
 ⚠        conflicts with base
 ?        unknown, GitHub still computing
 ◷ #n     waiting on #n below it in the
          stack

 AGENT DOT (Workspace view, end of PR line
 1)
 ●        working
 ◉        blocked, waiting on your input
 ○        idle (red row if its CI is
          failing)
 ?        agent state unknown (herdr not
          reachable)

 STACKS
 ▾ ▸      expanded / collapsed (h/l or ←/→)
 ╭─       base branch (main)
 ├─ n     layer n, counted up from main
 ◆▲◷◷     minimap, one glyph per layer, base
          first

 CHROME
 ▶        cursor row
 ✦        changed since you looked
  bar     header: view, scope, refresh time
 ⠹        fetching; ✗ offline + stale age

 KEYS
 j/k ↑/↓  move
 ⏎        jump to agent pane
 o        open PR in browser
 r        refresh
 s        authored/assigned (Mine)
 h/l ←/→  fold/unfold stack
 ␣        details drawer
 /        filter
 S        sort
 ?        help (close with ? or Esc)
 q        quit










j/k move ␣ details ⏎ jump o open ? keys
